  "notes": "{逆|さか}らう means to go against, oppose, or defy something or someone.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {自動詞|じどうし} (intransitive)\n- Takes に particle for what is being opposed\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {親|おや}に{逆|さか}らう: to disobey one's parents\n- {上司|じょうし}に{逆|さか}らう: to go against one's boss\n- {流|なが}れに{逆|さか}らう: to go against the current/trend\n- {運命|うんめい}に{逆|さか}らう: to defy fate\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {反対|はんたい}する: to oppose (neutral, can be positive)\n- {逆|さか}らう: to defy (often implies defiance of authority)\n- {背|そむ}く: to turn one's back on, to betray\n\n{逆|さか}らう often implies defying authority figures or established norms, and can carry a negative connotation.",
